WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.190
To pretrain at scale,

00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:06.510
the team assembled a massive tabular dataset from
Kaggle: about seven terabytes spanning

00:00:06.590 --> 00:00:08.445
three hundred and three domains,

00:00:08.525 --> 00:00:13.282
two hundred eighty-three thousand tables, and
roughly thirteen billion examples.

00:00:13.362 --> 00:00:18.421
On average each table has about twenty-nine
numerical columns and eight textual ones,

00:00:18.501 --> 00:00:22.350
with investing, finance, and economics among the
largest domains.

00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:25.373
For evaluation, they hold out twelve Kaggle tasks,

00:00:25.453 --> 00:00:29.303
six classification and six regression, never seen
in pretraining,

00:00:29.383 --> 00:00:34.140
plus seven widely used public benchmarks to compare
against established methods.
